  m_text: "READ AND DESTROY\r\nYour mission\r\nYou have 30 minutes to uncover who,
    how, and where the predicted fire will happen. If it ever happens! \r\n\r\nSuspects:
    Sabrina, Miriam, Betty\r\n\r\nInvestigate here before we regroup:\r\nSchool map:
    the gym, the toilets, the chapel, the classroom, the courtyard\r\n\r\nLook for
